I don't.

256
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:36,734
She took whatever heart I had with her.

257
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:39,248
Everyone says I'm a genius.

258
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:40,422
It's true, too.

259
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:44,238
I'm going to be the head of
the clan after my father.

260
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,817
I heard there's a loser in the Zenin clan.

261
00:20:48,900 --> 00:20:52,900
They say the man ain't got a bit
of cursed energy in his whole body.

262
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:55,907
He must be really depressed.

263
00:20:58,980 --> 00:21:01,580
I betcha that guy looks
pretty pathetic too.

264
00:21:05,940 --> 00:21:08,116
Three, four, five, nine, ten, eleven.

265
00:21:09,140 --> 00:21:09,970
You!

266
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:14,970
You!

267
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:20,800
Ain't no Toji!

268
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:25,900
The sin of the insignificant
is the ignorance of strength.

269
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:28,800
No one was able to understand Toji.

270
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:32,960
Except maybe City Gojo.

271
00:21:33,420 --> 00:21:34,940
But you ain't the one!

272
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,900
The one to stand among them!

273
00:21:44,740 --> 00:21:47,397
Projection sources can't be used to create

274
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:50,097
movements that ignore
physics and trajectory.

275
00:21:50,180 --> 00:21:51,597
There's a limit to how much acceleration

276
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:54,268
can be added to one's
speed upon activation.

277
00:21:54,420 --> 00:21:57,117
The longer the technique
is continuously activated,

278
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:59,435
the further one can raise their speed.

279
00:22:00,020 --> 00:22:01,477
No one to stand among them!

280
00:22:01,560 --> 00:22:02,440
It's me!

281
00:22:11,460 --> 00:22:12,940
I won't stop now.

282
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:15,515
I won't screw up like I did back then.

283
00:22:15,940 --> 00:22:18,140
Force is wait-time speed.

284
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,760
She wants a Hidden fight, huh?

285
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:41,060
How about a hug?

286
00:22:41,420 --> 00:22:43,538
I'll punch through her at top speed!

287
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:49,717
While Projection Sorcery is active,

288
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:51,657
anything the user touches
with their palm must

289
00:22:51,740 --> 00:22:54,257
create a movement within
1 24th of a second.

290
00:22:54,340 --> 00:22:57,105
If they fail, they'll be
frozen for one second.

291
00:23:01,780 --> 00:23:05,337
She was probably planning to take
my attack and stop my movement,

292
00:23:05,420 --> 00:23:07,440
even if it means I break her ribs.

293
00:23:07,700 --> 00:23:10,112
It's like I'd fall for such obvious bait.

294
00:23:10,320 --> 00:23:12,080
You really are an imposter!

295
00:23:17,020 --> 00:23:18,400
24 times, right?

296
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:21,680
You and old man now,
Beat, aren't just fast.

297
00:23:21,820 --> 00:23:24,114
There's something off about your speed.

298
00:23:24,300 --> 00:23:26,820
You are creating 24 motions per second.

299
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:29,965
I can finally see it
after obtaining this body.

300
00:23:31,940 --> 00:23:32,980
You imposter!

301
00:24:00,820 --> 00:24:02,137
Sorry.

302
00:24:02,220 --> 00:24:04,080
Can you repeat that?

303
00:24:05,100 --> 00:24:05,980
Mother.

304
00:24:11,180 --> 00:24:12,010
Mother.

305
00:24:21,700 --> 00:24:24,237
Mother stay away. Mother?

306
00:24:24,320 --> 00:24:25,677
Why must you?

307
00:24:25,760 --> 00:24:26,897
Why must you?

308
00:24:26,980 --> 00:24:28,157
Always be like this?

309
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,377
If that's the way you feel.

310
00:24:29,460 --> 00:24:30,617
Why?

311
00:24:30,700 --> 00:24:32,177
Tell me to come back? huh?

312
00:24:32,260 --> 00:24:33,337
What?

313
00:24:33,420 --> 00:24:35,320
What are you talking about?

314
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:39,760
No. No. No. No.

315
00:24:50,300 --> 00:24:52,620
Stupid bitch didn't end me.

316
00:24:53,300 --> 00:24:54,220
Pathetic.

317
00:25:04,740 --> 00:25:07,077
Are you kidding me?

318
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:10,340
I can't focus my cursed energy!

319
00:25:10,760 --> 00:25:12,820
Damn gutter trash!

320
00:25:18,780 --> 00:25:22,680
I'm glad I gave birth to you.

321
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:27,840
My!

322
00:25:35,260 --> 00:25:39,200
This is why I told you not to go.

323
00:25:44,140 --> 00:25:45,940
Please, take care of her.

324
00:25:46,140 --> 00:25:48,540
What are you going to do now, Maki?

325
00:25:58,180 --> 00:25:59,920
Thank you.

326
00:26:27,940 --> 00:26:33,617
The darkness descends anew and
the lonely shadow lurks around.

327
00:26:33,700 --> 00:26:37,297
Searching for its home in vain,
it's praying for redemption.

328
00:26:37,380 --> 00:26:40,957
As pitiful and wretched as it is.

329
00:26:41,040 --> 00:26:46,477
And slowly it begins,
seeds of hope bloom again.

330
00:26:46,560 --> 00:26:50,317
You are growing colder,
your breath is growing rare.

331
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:54,097
I reach out my hand and
it cuts through the air.

332
00:26:54,180 --> 00:26:57,720
Can we just go back to the way we were?

333
00:26:57,840 --> 00:27:03,277
The ever-surging waves rushing in to
swallow me When I'm moving forward,

334
00:27:03,360 --> 00:27:08,920
I destroy all that could be Will
the soothing end ever come for me?

335
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:14,137
So even if I get stabbed in the heart.

336
00:27:14,220 --> 00:27:15,937
Or I get torn apart.

337
00:27:16,020 --> 00:27:18,877
And then scattered around the world.

338
00:27:18,960 --> 00:27:21,637
I don't care, cause I'm not afraid.

339
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:25,577
As I'm already empty inside.

340
00:27:25,660 --> 00:27:28,757
Anyway, and so when the end has arrived?

341
00:27:28,840 --> 00:27:30,660
Could you turn off the light?

342
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:33,117
I don't want anything anymore.

343
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:36,737
Cause if there's one thing that I do fear.

344
00:27:36,820 --> 00:27:40,340
It's losing everything and everyone again.

345
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:52,937
Hakari was expelled for
clashing with the upper brass.

346
00:27:53,020 --> 00:27:53,900
A fight club?

347
00:27:54,040 --> 00:27:55,477
You don't talk about the fight club.

348
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:58,997
I can't get close Itadori you
snoop around from the inside.

349
00:27:59,080 --> 00:28:00,357
I love it when you're hot!

350
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:03,381
Are you saying you want
to get high on my passion?
